docs {
Catat download foto Unsplash (22-api-share-backgrounds.md).
Publik, tanpa auth. Dipanggil client saat user memilih foto Unsplash
di Media Explorer (Unsplash API Guidelines - Triggering Downloads).
200 { tracked } - tracked=false bila UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY kosong / upstream gagal.
400 VALIDATION_ERROR bila `id` bukan ID foto Unsplash.
}

meta {
  name: Track Unsplash Download
  seq: 10
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/share/backgrounds/unsplash/download
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "id": "Dwu85P9SOIk"
  }
}

tests {
  test("200 + tracked boolean", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.success).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data.tracked).to.be.a("boolean");
  });
}
